      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹1.84 (down from ₹4.13 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹254.0m (down 21% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹36.9m (down 40% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 14% (down from 19% in 3Q 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by lower revenue. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 24% per year whereas the company’s share price has increased by 27% per year.",
