      "title": "Swastika Investmart Limited Announces Executive Changes, Effective April 1, 2026",
      "body": "Swastika Investmart Limited has announced the change in designation of Mr. Mohit Goyal from Compliance Officer to Principal Officer of Merchant Banking Division, who is part of Senior Management of the company, effective from April 1, 2026. The company has also appointed Ms. Mansi Malviya as Compliance Officer for the Merchant Banking Division and designated her as Senior Management Personnel of the Company effective from April 1, 2026. The Board Meeting was held on January 22, 2026. Mr. Mohit Goyal, Date of Birth 04 August 1993, aged 32 years, is a qualified Company Secretary, Master in Business Administration (MBA), B.Com and has cleared NISM Series IX – Merchant Banking and NISM Series III-A – Compliance Officer. He is a qualified Company Secretary and an experienced compliance professi",
